WEBVTT

00:08:28.152 --> 00:08:30.034
kujibu haya maswali matatu

00:08:30.034 --> 00:08:31.417
kutadhamiria ufanisi wako

00:08:31.417 --> 00:08:34.886
kama kiongozi wa karne ya 21.

00:08:34.886 --> 00:08:39.307
Kipi kinachotengeneza kiongozi bora wa karne ya 21?

00:08:39.307 --> 00:08:42.856
Nimekutana na wengi,na wanasimama vinara.

00:08:42.856 --> 00:08:44.507
Ni wanaume kwa wanawake

00:08:44.507 --> 00:08:46.273
waliojiandaa

00:08:46.273 --> 00:08:49.392
sio kwa uhuru wa utabiri wa jana

00:08:49.392 --> 00:08:53.168
lakini pia kwa uhalisi wa kesho

00:08:53.168 --> 00:08:57.429
na yasiyowezekana yote ya kesho

00:08:57.429 --> 00:08:59.856
Asante.

00:08:59.856 --> 00:09:02.534
(Makofi)